1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,600
Sari opens an issue in the community that buyers and authors share.

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:08,280
Ten percent of every use already flows into a fund governed by a Sputnik DAO on NEAR.

3
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:15,860
Sari and other users pool money for a bounty, locked in an escrow contract that pays only when the DAO approves the fix, and refunds everyone if it doesn't.

4
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:22,450
The contributor's fix becomes the next version of Arif's method, and from then on the market contract pays them a royalty on every run.

